---Calls an operation with a boto3-shaped table and returns the decoded, PascalCase
---response. Service errors and unknown input members raise. Setup only. For `s3`, `sns`,
---`iam`, `sts` and `cloudformation` the operation and its input and output tables are typed.
---@param service roto.UntypedService
---@param operation string AWS operation name, for example `SendMessage`.
---@param input? table
---@return any
--@@CALL_OVERLOADS@@
function roto.call(service, operation, input) end

